tank-model-text "Inspector\nWater tank\nTK-01\nProperties\nPhysical model\nWater tank\n\nWell-mixed liquid water with ambient heat exchange.\n\nHydraulic quantities use SI internally. Vented finite tanks enforce inventory boundaries. Motor current includes shaft back EMF; pump load feeds back into acceleration. Zero-volume pipes carry heat conservatively; travel time and water hammer are deferred.\n\nControllers use the simulation clock. Relay contact resistance dissipates I²R into its thermal mass. Sensors read the selected thermal state. Cooling uses UA(T − Tcoolant) to an ideal reservoir. The independent cutoff has its own sensor and latching series contact. Switching arcs and coil power are omitted.\n\nRead model documentation\nComponent cost\n€40.00"
